'''Nikoku Dosei''' (二黒土星) is one of the {{ill|Nine Stars|ja|九星}} used in {{ill|calendars|ja|暦}} and {{ill|fortune-telling|ja|占い}}.
Among the Nine Stars, other Earth-associated stars include {{ill|Goō Dosei|1=Fifth Yellow Earth Star|ja|五黄土星}} and {{ill|Happaku Dosei|ja|八白土星}}. However, Nikoku Dosei represents flatlands and agricultural soil, in contrast to the destructive and rugged terrain associated with Goō Dosei.
== Attributes == * {{ill|Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)|lt=Wuxing|ja|五行思想}} - Earth * {{ill|Bagua|ja|八卦}} - Kun (坤) * {{ill|Heavenly Stems|lt=Ten Heavenly Stems|ja|十干}} - Wu (戊), Ji (己) * {{ill|Earthly Branches|lt=Twelve Earthly Branches|ja|十二支}} - Wei (未), Shen (申) * Season - {{ill|Doyō (season)|ja|土用}} * Direction - Southwest * Month - July, August * Time - 13:00–17:00 * Number - Five, Ten * Color - Yellow * Taste - Sweet
== Symbolic Meanings == * Diligence, obedience, humility, old age, delays, simplicity * Masses, common people, land, gatherings, squares, futons, sweets, elderly women, mothers
== Relationships with Other Stars == * Generating Cycle (相生) - {{ill|Roppaku Kinsei|1=Sixth White Metal Star|ja|六白金星}} (Earth produces Metal), {{ill|Shichiseki Kinsei|1=Seventh Red Metal Star|ja|七赤金星}} (Earth produces Metal), {{ill|Kyūshi Kasei|ja|九紫火星}} (Fire produces Earth) * Overcoming Cycle (相克) - {{ill|Ippaku Suisei|ja|一白水星|1=First White Water Star}} (Earth overcomes Water), {{ill|Sanpeki Mokusei|ja|三碧木星|1=Third Blue Wood Star}} (Wood overcomes Earth), {{ill|Shiroku Mokusei|ja|四緑木星|1=Fourth Green Wood Star}} (Wood overcomes Earth) * Harmonious Relationship (比和) - Nikoku Dosei, {{ill|Goō Dosei|1=Fifth Yellow Earth Star|ja|五黄土星}}, {{ill|Happaku Dosei|ja|八白土星}}
== Years in Which Nikoku Dosei Occupies the Center == Years that are exactly divisible by 9 correspond to Nikoku Dosei years.
‥‥- [[1935]] - [[1944]] - [[1953]] - [[1962]] - [[1971]] - [[1980]] - [[1989]] - [[1998]] - [[2007]] - [[2016]] - [[2025]] - [[2034]] - [[2043]] - [[2052]] - [[2061]] - [[2070]] - ‥‥
