{| class="floatright wikitable" style="text-align:center; font-family:serif;" |+ When Nikoku is in the center |- | 1 || 6 || 8 |- | 9 || style="background-color:#FF80C0; font-weight:bold;" | 2 || 4 |- | 5 || 7 || 3 |}
'''Nikoku Dosei''' (二黒土星) is one of the {{ill|Nine Stars|ja|九星|qq=draft|qq=}} used in {{ill|calendars|ja|暦|qq=draft|qq=}} and {{ill|fortune-telling|ja|占い|qq=draft|qq=}}.
Among the Nine Stars, other Earth-associated stars include {{ill|Goō Dosei|1=Fifth Yellow Earth Star|ja|五黄土星|qq=draft|qq=}} and {{ill|Happaku Dosei|1=Eighth White Earth Star|ja|八白土星|qq=draft|qq=}}. However, Nikoku Dosei represents flatlands and agricultural soil, in contrast to the destructive and rugged terrain associated with Goō Dosei.
== Attributes == * {{ill|Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)|lt=Wuxing|ja|五行思想|1=Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)|2=ja|3=五行思想|lt=Five Elements (Wuxing)|qq=draft|qq=}} - Earth * {{ill|Bagua|ja|八卦|qq=draft|qq=}} - Kun (坤) * {{ill|Heavenly Stems|lt=Ten Heavenly Stems|ja|十干|qq=draft|qq=}} - Wu (戊), Ji (己) * {{ill|Earthly Branches|lt=Twelve Earthly Branches|ja|十二支|qq=draft|qq=}} - Wei (未), Shen (申) * Season - {{ill|Doyō (season)|ja|土用|qq=draft|qq=}} * Direction - Southwest * Month - July, August * Time - 13:00–17:00 * Number - Five, Ten * Color - Yellow * Taste - Sweet
== Symbolic Meanings == * Diligence, obedience, humility, old age, delays, simplicity * Masses, common people, land, gatherings, squares, futons, sweets, elderly women, mothers
== Relationships with Other Stars == * Generating Cycle (相生) - {{ill|Roppaku Kinsei|1=Sixth White Metal Star|ja|六白金星|qq=draft|qq=}} (Earth produces Metal), {{ill|Shichiseki Kinsei|1=Seventh Red Metal Star|ja|七赤金星|qq=draft|qq=}} (Earth produces Metal), {{ill|Kyūshi Kasei|1=Ninth Purple Fire Star|ja|九紫火星|qq=draft|qq=}} (Fire produces Earth) * Overcoming Cycle (相克) - {{ill|Ippaku Suisei|ja|一白水星|1=First White Water Star|qq=draft|qq=}} (Earth overcomes Water), {{ill|Sanpeki Mokusei|ja|三碧木星|1=Third Blue Wood Star|qq=draft|qq=}} (Wood overcomes Earth), {{ill|Shiroku Mokusei|ja|四緑木星|1=Fourth Green Wood Star|qq=draft|qq=}} (Wood overcomes Earth) * Harmonious Relationship (比和) - Nikoku Dosei, {{ill|Goō Dosei|1=Fifth Yellow Earth Star|ja|五黄土星|qq=draft|qq=}}, {{ill|Happaku Dosei|1=Eighth White Earth Star|ja|八白土星|qq=draft|qq=}}
== Years in Which Nikoku Dosei Occupies the Center == Years that are exactly divisible by 9 correspond to Nikoku Dosei years.
‥‥- [[1935]] - [[1944]] - [[1953]] - [[1962]] - [[1971]] - [[1980]] - [[1989]] - [[1998]] - [[2007]] - [[2016]] - [[2025]] - [[2034]] - [[2043]] - [[2052]] - [[2061]] - [[2070]] - ‥‥
