'''Nikoku Dosei''' (二黒土星) is one of the {{ill|Nine Stars|ja|九星|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Nine Stars|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Nine Stars|qq=}} used in {{ill|calendars|ja|暦|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/calendars|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/calendars|qq=}} and {{ill|fortune-telling|ja|占い|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/fortune-telling|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/fortune-telling|qq=}}.

Among the Nine Stars, other Earth-associated stars include {{ill|Goō Dosei|1=Fifth Yellow Earth Star|ja|五黄土星|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Goō Dosei|13=User:Immanuelle/Fifth Yellow Earth Star|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Goō Dosei|13=User:Immanuelle/Fifth Yellow Earth Star|qq=}} and {{ill|Happaku Dosei|1=Eighth White Earth Star|ja|八白土星|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Happaku Dosei|13=User:Immanuelle/Eighth White Earth Star|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Happaku Dosei|13=User:Immanuelle/Eighth White Earth Star|qq=}}. However, Nikoku Dosei represents flatlands and agricultural soil, in contrast to the destructive and rugged terrain associated with Goō Dosei.

== Attributes ==
* {{ill|Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)|lt=Wuxing|ja|五行思想|1=Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)|2=ja|3=五行思想|lt=Five Elements (Wuxing)|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)|13=User:Immanuelle/Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)|13=User:Immanuelle/Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)|qq=}} - Earth
* {{ill|Bagua|ja|八卦|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Bagua|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Bagua|qq=}} - Kun (坤)
* {{ill|Heavenly Stems|lt=Ten Heavenly Stems|ja|十干|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Heavenly Stems|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Heavenly Stems|qq=}} - Wu (戊), Ji (己)
* {{ill|Earthly Branches|lt=Twelve Earthly Branches|ja|十二支|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Earthly Branches|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Earthly Branches|qq=}} - Wei (未), Shen (申)
* Season - {{ill|Doyō (season)|ja|土用|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Doyō (season)|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Doyō (season)|qq=}}
* Direction - Southwest
* Month - July, August
* Time - 13:00–17:00
* Number - Five, Ten
* Color - Yellow
* Taste - Sweet

== Symbolic Meanings ==
* Diligence, obedience, humility, old age, delays, simplicity
* Masses, common people, land, gatherings, squares, futons, sweets, elderly women, mothers

== Relationships with Other Stars ==
* Generating Cycle (相生) - {{ill|Roppaku Kinsei|1=Sixth White Metal Star|ja|六白金星|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Roppaku Kinsei|13=User:Immanuelle/Sixth White Metal Star|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Roppaku Kinsei|13=User:Immanuelle/Sixth White Metal Star|qq=}} (Earth produces Metal), {{ill|Shichiseki Kinsei|1=Seventh Red Metal Star|ja|七赤金星|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Shichiseki Kinsei|13=User:Immanuelle/Seventh Red Metal Star|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Shichiseki Kinsei|13=User:Immanuelle/Seventh Red Metal Star|qq=}} (Earth produces Metal), {{ill|Kyūshi Kasei|1=Ninth Purple Fire Star|ja|九紫火星|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kyūshi Kasei|13=User:Immanuelle/Ninth Purple Fire Star|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kyūshi Kasei|13=User:Immanuelle/Ninth Purple Fire Star|qq=}} (Fire produces Earth)
* Overcoming Cycle (相克) - {{ill|Ippaku Suisei|ja|一白水星|1=First White Water Star|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Ippaku Suisei|13=User:Immanuelle/First White Water Star|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Ippaku Suisei|13=User:Immanuelle/First White Water Star|qq=}} (Earth overcomes Water), {{ill|Sanpeki Mokusei|ja|三碧木星|1=Third Blue Wood Star|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Sanpeki Mokusei|13=User:Immanuelle/Third Blue Wood Star|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Sanpeki Mokusei|13=User:Immanuelle/Third Blue Wood Star|qq=}} (Wood overcomes Earth), {{ill|Shiroku Mokusei|ja|四緑木星|1=Fourth Green Wood Star|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Shiroku Mokusei|13=User:Immanuelle/Fourth Green Wood Star|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Shiroku Mokusei|13=User:Immanuelle/Fourth Green Wood Star|qq=}} (Wood overcomes Earth)
* Harmonious Relationship (比和) - Nikoku Dosei, {{ill|Goō Dosei|1=Fifth Yellow Earth Star|ja|五黄土星|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Goō Dosei|13=User:Immanuelle/Fifth Yellow Earth Star|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Goō Dosei|13=User:Immanuelle/Fifth Yellow Earth Star|qq=}}, {{ill|Happaku Dosei|1=Eighth White Earth Star|ja|八白土星|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Happaku Dosei|13=User:Immanuelle/Eighth White Earth Star|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Happaku Dosei|13=User:Immanuelle/Eighth White Earth Star|qq=}}

== Years in Which Nikoku Dosei Occupies the Center ==
Years that are exactly divisible by 9 correspond to Nikoku Dosei years.

‥‥- [[1935]] - [[1944]] - [[1953]] - [[1962]] - [[1971]] - [[1980]] - [[1989]] - [[1998]] - [[2007]] - [[2016]] - [[2025]] - [[2034]] - [[2043]] - [[2052]] - [[2061]] - [[2070]] - ‥‥

